{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32326-non-western-organizations","id":32326,"title":"Non-Western Organizations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-18T05:51:20-08:00","id":32326,"title":"Non-Western Organizations","content":"<span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Times\">So the NWoD has had an obvious western focus. Largely it's understandable in the sense that Western writers don't want to fuck up a culture not their own, and the White Wolf/Onyx Path writers are sensitive to this given the history of Classic World of Darkness with regard to things like Orientalism, portrayal of the Rroma, the original Akashic Tradition book, almost all the WtA Tribes that corresponded to real world cultures (later editions got better with them by trying to focus on tying the Garou Tribes to those culture's mythologies rather than stereotypes of the actual cultures, but they will never live down the drunken Irishmen of the Fianna, and the Nazi Fenrir).<br /> <br /> ANYWAY, so its not an area delved into in official published material, but I am curious what people have come up with in their own games, or undeveloped ideas they have.<br /> <br /> A few I have for East Asia...<br /> <br /> The Black Ring - originating out of the Yakuza (though reimaginable to fit any organized crime syndicate, like the Triads, Bravta, or La Costa Nostra) this criminal Compact hunts Changelings and potentialy other pact-forming supernaturals in order to force the granting of their wishes. It's an element of faerie-hunting in legend (seeking your wishes granted) that weren't explored as fully with the groups that made it into Dream-Catchers. I went with the Yakuza here for 2 reasons, 1) the historic bakuto roots fit well for people hunting magic luck and wealth; and 2) it's a reference to &quot;Crossing Midnight&quot; which I loved.<br /> <br /> Bardo Thodol - a Vajrayana Buddhist Compact that sees the restless dead, including Geists, as souls stuck in the pretas state that need to helped along the cycle of reincarnation. Named for the Tibetan Book of the Dead.<br /> <br /> The Xuanmiao Ministry - the Chinese answer to Task Force VALKYRIE, DRU, and KSI (though older than all of them in one form or another). They use weirder tech than VALKYRIE's Advanced Armory, via God-Machine related discoveries; and seek not to destroy, but to reprogram supernaturals into serving the harmony of the state.<br /> <br /> There's also a DRU agency in India - the J\u00f1\u0101n\u0101t\u012bta Bureau. DRU goes back to the Victorian period, so it can be found woven into the intelligence agencies of several Commonwealth countries. The J\u00f1\u0101n\u0101t\u012bta Bureau is to India as MI-18 is to the UK, both equally DRU.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I was considering adapting the Shih from the OWoD, but I don't feel like they have enough in-built darkness for a Conspiracy as is. Note that of all the Conspiracies, the ones who are the most unambiguous Good-Guys, are the ones who get their powers from their satanic bloodline. Their Endowments are so steeped in darkness, that the Lucifuge don't need to balance it. But in general, Tier 3 is all about blurring the line between the Hunter and the supernatural (see the core's sidebar on the hypocrisy of Endowments), and the moral compromise inherent in that. So if there are going to be a mystical Taoist warrior Conspiracy, they or their powers need some darkness somewhere (institutionally speaking - individuals always get to be heroes). My best idea right now is to make them an Internal Alchemist splinter from the Ascending Ones (with many of their own Elixers). You have the themes of balance via the sahu tradition, while the drug angle brings the darkness. Thoughts?</span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T06:20:29-08:00","id":32333,"title":"","content":"Well, I've had few ideas for a non western organizations, but I'm kinda afraid to develop them (for the same reasons you've talked about. I don't want to fall into stereotypes). The ideas are a Shinto based conspiracy/ compact, a Japanese governmental organization which is specialize in using virtual reality tech (and could potentially project them into real life) and maybe evolving one idea I've read about somewhere in the forums (don't remember where) about a Chinese organization which kidnap sleepwalkers and turn them into something.. else by training them. I'm especially afraid of making the Shinto one, because I may have watched too many animes and it may influence my writeup :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T07:05:19-08:00","id":32365,"title":"","content":"I would like an explosion of non Western Hunter groups mentioned, even if not statted out.<br /> <br /> A few ideas:<br /> <br /> A Nomadic conspiracy that originated from the Golden Horde (That could be a cool name too), but by the modern times they evolved to spread into various vagrant communities likes the Rroma, various Traveler communities (like Brad Pitts folks in Snatch), Bedouins, and other nomadic individuals. They guard the roads, and protect loners and naturally spread into disenfranchised minorities throughout Asia and the west. Looking out for things that prey on loners I could see them hunting the Fae, and just uprooting random local threats, like rest stop cults that tan and skin vagrants into sellable trinkets.<br /> <br /> Various Diasporas could have inspired either the growth of hunter groups or the birth of them as they spread into foreign countries, such as with Cambodian and Mung minorities moving into US and Canada, they have some native animistic religions so maybe spirit/ghost dealers. <br /> <br /> Maybe Filipino Menangallan/Aswang Vampire Hunters.<br /> <br /> I love Ang Bak and the Protector so I could see an old line of Siamese Elephant Warriors that use Muai Thai, possibly tie it in to fighting not just exotic animal poaching but human trafficking and how its used by the supernatural.<br /> <br /> The opposite of this would be an Asian group of Hunter Poachers who poach not just rare animals, but Supernaturals to sell on the Herbal Black Market, kind of a less conglomerate version of Cheiron, where instead of grafting parts they convert/sell potent parts for herbalism. This is prevalent throughout most of Asian culture in general.<br /> <br /> I would love a Sikh hunter group, there was an article a while back about a dying Sikh Martial Art that maybe had only one master left trying to preserve it for future generations. They would be a very protect the local community type of group.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T07:42:25-08:00","id":32400,"title":"","content":"Of the ones I've already written, these might or might not qualify depending on how you define Western:<br /> <br /> The Marduk Society (from Leviathan) I'm not sure wheather they really belong here give then they're basically pulp heroes, a very western literary tradition. However they trace their origins to ancient Mesopotamia and while it's not mentioned in the text, their primary headquarters is in the middle of the Sahara Desert. (For obvious reasons Leviathans don't like deserts so Marduk's major installations are all in deserts, flying or orbital.) The original Conspiracy was based around eating Leviathans to gain immortality but they recurited so many genuinely noble dupes that the idealists because the majority of the Conspiracy. Pretty soon they'll take over completely and the Society will have it's second golden age (to contrast Leviathans who haven't made any progress in restoring their golden age)<br /> <br /> Hakollel shel Hamerkava: A Jewish Conspiracy (the irony of those words amuses me greatly) closely tied to the formation of Israel, and while pretty loose and international it's naturally strongest in Israel. Their primary purpose is to prevent the misuse of Shemot, their Endowment, (this parallels the Demiurges misuse of the stolen divine fire). Individual members may also sideline in using magic for mundane community good works, protecting their community form monsters, trying to reverse the mistake of the Tammuz Lineage, or perusing their own pilgrimage like journey based on study and debate. On a Doyalist level the whole concept of elderly Rabbis trying to adapt to a post-Israel and increasingly secular world is a parallel to the blank slate Promethean.<br /> <br /> The Order of St. Anthony: An Eastern Orthodox (that's not Western right? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) Compact based around the core theme of endurance. These monks and priests can survive things that would kill other hunters through pure willpower, a trick they need to deal with the nearly unending amount of dead created by The Great Patriotic War and the Communist atrocities. If I wrote them again I'd probably make them a far older Conspiracy who's clawing their way back after the Communist purges and wield Benedictions.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I also have a couple of unwritten ideas.<br /> <br /> I don't have a name yet, but a monastery of wuxia style Tibetan martial artists monks. Saffron robes, bald heads and supernatural martial arts. Their monastery is built upon a massive gateway to hell, probably one of the top 10 in the world and their order is dedicated to maintaining the seals upon that gate (there's precedent for this in Buddhism). I originally conceived of them as part of the Princess setting (though under Princess rules, that gate would have been permanently purified by now), though in practice it makes little difference if you base them on Inferno or Princess. The Chinese government know exactly who they are and felt the simplest solution was to just fund them.<br /> <br /> A God-Machine focused Chinese Government conspiracy, in a Doylist sense, in a Watsonian sense they have no correlation. Their Endowment is supercomputers running predictive mathematical models that let you do Bill and Ted like tricks. &quot;I knew you were going to ambush me, so I placed a landmine right there yesterday!&quot;. Thematically the core idea is that you're playing as angels or as the G-M, depending on you Status. Their Endowment would work by high level PCs giving nonsense orders to underlings in order to set up complex butterflies of doom.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T08:52:51-08:00","id":32440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32326-non-western-organizations?p=32400#post32400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Marduk Society (from Leviathan) I'm not sure wheather they really belong here give then they're basically pulp heroes, a very western literary tradition. However they trace their origins to ancient Mesopotamia and while it's not mentioned in the text, their primary headquarters is in the middle of the Sahara Desert. (For obvious reasons Leviathans don't like deserts so Marduk's major installations are all in deserts, flying or orbital.) The original Conspiracy was based around eating Leviathans to gain immortality but they recurited so many genuinely noble dupes that the idealists because the majority of the Conspiracy. Pretty soon they'll take over completely and the Society will have it's second golden age (to contrast Leviathans who haven't made any progress in restoring their golden age)<br /> <br /> Hakollel shel Hamerkava: A Jewish Conspiracy (the irony of those words amuses me greatly) closely tied to the formation of Israel, and while pretty loose and international it's naturally strongest in Israel. Their primary purpose is to prevent the misuse of Shemot, their Endowment, (this parallels the Demiurges misuse of the stolen divine fire). Individual members may also sideline in using magic for mundane community good works, protecting their community form monsters, trying to reverse the mistake of the Tammuz Lineage, or perusing their own pilgrimage like journey based on study and debate. On a Doyalist level the whole concept of elderly Rabbis trying to adapt to a post-Israel and increasingly secular world is a parallel to the blank slate Promethean.</div> </div> </div> </div>well, if a Jewish/ Israeli organization and a Mesopotamian organization are considered as non Western, Than I have two more :P<br /> <br /> The first is Raziel Ltd (my best developed idea). they are an Israeli weapon company which use a sacred technology in order to channel their auras and make connections with the higher powers. You may say they use the God Machine in order to &quot;speak with god&quot; more easily (they can use their endowments without the tech itself, but it is much harder). They have many dirty secrets and use the Book of Raziel Ha'Malach as source of power, and their primary goal is to find Empyrean Phenomena and fight the influence of the Cheiron Group. The CEO is the son of the original founder, and he seems kinda weird to most of the members of the company.<br /> <br /> The second is going to be a second draft for an old idea. They are hunters which originated from a cult of the Babylonian goddess Ereshkigal and believe themselves to be her messengers in the world of the living. They believe that the dead escaping the underworld is an offense against the laws of Lady Death, and they must make sure that what is dead stays dead. They are also dying, and lost many of their powers and secrets, being on the verge of losing their status as a conspiracy. Originally they were religious fanatics, but I'm trying to think about some other reason for them to hunt except of &quot;Ereshkigal told me&quot;. Their powers are focused around calling down the memories of mankind from the underworld and shaping them into weapon which can harm the dead, and those who are killed by those weapon don't get a second chance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T08:56:05-08:00","id":32442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32326-non-western-organizations#post32326\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My best idea right now is to make them an Internal Alchemist splinter from the Ascending Ones (with many of their own Elixers). You have the themes of balance via the sahu tradition, while the drug angle brings the darkness. Thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>Why a splinter? The Ascending Ones do practice internal alchemy - that's how they survive those poisons. Why not make them full members of the Ascending Ones?<br /> <br /> Anyway, that's my thought. Apart from that go for it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32326-non-western-organizations?p=32440#post32440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> well, if a Jewish/ Israeli organization and a Mesopotamian organization are considered as non Western</div> </div> </div> </div>Well it is called the Middle <i>East</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T08:57:35-08:00","id":32444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32326-non-western-organizations?p=32442#post32442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well it is called the Middle <i>East</i></div> </div> </div> </div>lol- well, let's just say that most Israeli won't like to be named as non Western :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T09:40:24-08:00","id":32484,"title":"","content":"Geography is a cruel mistress :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T10:42:53-08:00","id":32548,"title":"","content":"I have a couple of ideas for a Japanese compact and conspiracy.<br /> <br /> The compact would essentially be a biker gang that fights monsters. This idea was inspired (ripped off entirely) from the motorbike gang in Akira. Nothing specifically japanese about them but if I ever were to write them up I would highlight the mis-spent youth and teenager angle to hopefully give them a different feel from something like the Hells Angels.<br /> <br /> The conspiracy would be essentially made up of ninjas. My idea was to try to create a group that would allow any type of pop culture ninja to be playable, with different factions focusing on different things. The endowment would be Ninpo. Ninja magic. This would essentially be a mix of genuine magical powers alongside to specialised equipment to give them an edge. Smoke bombs, poisoned blow-darts and grappling hooks to the ability to create a mirror-image illusion of oneself and summon razor-sharp winds. The magical affects would require a short preparation time, so timing is crucial for their effective use.<br /> <br /> There would a stealthly, hit and run faction, which would be the classic sneaky, rooftop clambering throat slitting ninja. Not specifically supernaturally powered but with a lot of nifty skills and equipment that would give them an edge. Iconic ninjas Rikimaru and Ayame from the Tenchu games.<br /> <br /> There would be a more action focused, martial focused faction This would be like Ninja Gaiden, although not as over the top. These would type would favour a more direct confrontation and would bring the right weapon for the right type of monster. Bow and arrows against Vampires. Silver Sythes against werewolves. Iconic Ninja. Hayabusa<br /> <br /> Then there would be an infiltration based faction. These are Ninja who hide in plain sight. They don't appear as the the pop culture type Ninja but are just as highly skilled as their counterparts. These would serve as spies. Observing, gathering information and waiting for the right time to strike. Imagine a company is suspected of having been influenced by a vampire. One of these guys would be sent in as an employee to ferret the information out. Or perhaps a CEO of another company suggests a merger to get ahold of information that will reveal the monster. Iconic Ninja: Bruce Wayne. (Batman, without the vigilant focus).<br /> <br /> Problem with this idea is that it is essentially ridiculous and reconciling the more cheesy aspects with Hunter's more mature tone is a challenge. I think it could work, but the idea needs toning down thats for sure. I have a rough idea of how the factions would work in a way that is coherent but haven't really fleshed out the back-story or anything like that yet. Of course this idea is in no way tied in with genuine Japanese culture either which is kind of a blow against it as well. :-)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1161-gravitas-man","name":"Gravitas Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1161_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T12:49:08-08:00","id":32646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32326-non-western-organizations?p=32442#post32442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why a splinter? The Ascending Ones do practice internal alchemy - that's how they survive those poisons. Why not make them full members of the Ascending Ones?</div> </div> </div> </div>But none of their three factions are based in Taoist philosophy, and the Trismegistus symbolism precludes additional groups. I mean... I guess you could say &quot;all religion belongs in the Knife of Paradise&quot; - but that completely different nature of the militant bent on the Western religions vs. the Eastern philosophical traditions in question.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T13:27:16-08:00","id":32670,"title":"","content":"Well I was thinking of a forth Fraction, though you might have a point with the Trismegistus symbolism. I say might because I don't know anything about Trismegistus symbolism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T13:34:19-08:00","id":32683,"title":"","content":"If memory serves Trismegistus literally means 'Thrice great'.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":178,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","user":"Michael","date":". 12-18-2013, 06:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T14:11:16-08:00","id":32706,"title":"","content":"So it's as simple as having three Factions? I'd say that the AO has dozens to hundreds of sub groups that fit into one of three overarching themes. Depending on how vaguely you deifne these themes: &quot;Holy warriors&quot; or &quot;seekers of alchemical wisdom&quot;, I think you could squeeze Taoists into one of those two. What do you think Glamourweaver?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T15:08:00-08:00","id":32742,"title":"","content":"I'm not super comfortable taking the hypothetical Taoist Alchemist group and saying &quot;well we're really part of this Ancient Egyptian Cult&quot;. I think they work better having a completely separate organization and leadership, and have a long history of cultural exchange with the Ascending Ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T16:49:44-08:00","id":32828,"title":"","content":"Agreed. The Taoist alchemy is vastly different from the Ascending Ones more Westernized alchemy, and I feel it deserves a standalone look as a separate entity from the Ascending Ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T23:46:14-08:00","id":32993,"title":"","content":"Sudden idea - DRU agencies are connected via a shared global computer mainframe, which was of course bleeding edge future tech when Turing secretly invented it. Agencies being &quot;DRU&quot; is based on whether they are on said mainframe. Pakistan's Special Directorate (within ISI) took itself off the mainframe in '71 out of fear that Indian or Bangladeshi rebel access would be a security risk - effectively leaving DRU. This was itself significantly longer than it took Israel, who immediately unplugged after copying as much data as they could when they gained independence in '48.<br /> <br /> South Africa's access was sabotaged, the Turing Engines destroyed in a bombing by Umkhonto we Sizwe in the 60s, who probably got the strong suggestion of what building they should bomb from DRU agents from other African countries.<br /> <br /> Countries with active DRU agencies on the mainframe includes (but is not necessarily limited to) the UK, Canada, India, Australia, Singapore, Malaysia, Ghana, Kenya, Tanzania, Nigeria, &amp; Uganda.<br /> <br /> And there definitely isn't still a cell in Hong Kong on the mainframe.... <b><i>definitely</i></b>... that's crazy talk...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 12-19-2013, 02:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T02:34:19-08:00","id":33023,"title":"","content":"The Eclipse Protocol: A West African conspiracy focused around a defunct pan-African police service - these guys were supposed to be the African equivalent of Europol, but they discovered things that were too dangerous and too deep working on the continent, things they couldn't deal with officially, and so went dark. They now pride themselves on anonymity, using masks that not only change their appearance, but their personality and memories. Noone is quite sure what the masks are made of, but they know they work well, perhaps too well..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/209-that-other-guy","name":"That Other Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T02:56:16-08:00","id":33028,"title":"","content":"Well the way I see it, a separate organisation and leadership with a long history of cultural exchange <i>is</i> how I'd define membership of the Ascending Ones, and Elixir involve a lot of Taoist style Internal Alchemy already; but enough of that tangent. You know how these things go. Whoever writes it decides <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Next up: The DRU. I'm curious as to why these countries are working together? Do you still see the DRU's goal as a straight forward goal of policing mad science?<br /> <br /> <br /> The Eclipse Protocol. I like that a lot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T06:41:35-08:00","id":33138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32326-non-western-organizations?p=33028#post33028\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Next up: The DRU. I'm curious as to why these countries are working together? Do you still see the DRU's goal as a straight forward goal of policing mad science?</div> </div> </div> </div>The database is an extremely useful resource on mad science tech and supernatural weirdness, and completely unhackable (only the original Turing Engines can interface with it and each other). So maintaining that connection is in the agencies' interests... unless like Pakistan or Israel they decide it isn't worth it.<br /> <br /> That is the central focus of MI-18, but outside Canada and the UK, in the non-NATO Commonwealth members, Task Force VALKYRIE doesn't have a permanently active presence incorporating local intelligence resources. In those countries the DRU agencies use their mad science resources toward the broader goal of protecting their nation from all supernatural theats - since VALKYRIE isn't (always) there claiming jurisdiction.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T07:36:30-08:00","id":33175,"title":"","content":"So it's basically an intelligence sharing agreement between otherwise independent organisations?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T07:55:54-08:00","id":33190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32326-non-western-organizations?p=33175#post33175\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So it's basically an intelligence sharing agreement between otherwise independent organisations?</div> </div> </div> </div>Effectively - and it facilitates the same Endowment tech. But they don't have a united leadership. DRU was throughout the Empire before decolonialism, so those resources kept being used by the sovereign governments.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T08:03:50-08:00","id":33197,"title":"","content":"Ok. I can't see anything wrong with that.<br /> <br /> I probably won't use it for my MI18 though, I went with a theme of &quot;Trying to stop the world from changing; failing&quot; to contrast mad scientists, so the leadership are <i>still</i> bitter at the loss of the British Empire. I imagine the others would have issues with that attitude <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> [edit] To clarify, I don't plan to use the information sharing. The idea that there are many former Hunter organisations that originated as a branch of the British Empire's DRU works fine with MI18 as I wrote them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 12-19-2013, 11:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T08:47:38-08:00","id":33232,"title":"","content":"One historical point which you can take or leave; Israel wasn't formed out of the British Imperial bureaucracy and military structure in the way that many British colonial states were. It developed separately out of the various wings of the Zionist Organisation, and it was always quite separate. Further, the IDF and the Israeli security services developed out of militias and terrorist groups whom the British saw as enemies.<br /> <br /> I really doubt MI-18 would let people who are effectively their enemies gain access to bleeding edge tech.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T02:10:29-08:00","id":40988,"title":"","content":"New idea: The Prarabdhavat (the fruit bearing banyan tree) are a Hindu Conspiracy who bring karmic justice from actions against past lives to immortals whose nature allows them to otherwise avoid the karmic ramifications of betraying dharma. Their Endowments involve unlocking skills, knowledge, and abilities of past lives, as well as triggering what we might call &quot;fate&quot; (though they don't see it that way) to take actions against their guilty foes.<br /> <br /> I considered letting a Hindu Conspiracy wield siddhis, but the philosophy surrounding siddhis is so based around having already achieved enlightenment, and the illusion of the perceived world, etc - that it just fits so much better as Awakened Magic for the WoD [there should really be a &quot;Tradition&quot; write up for sadhana yoga], and not the type of thing someone should get access through via an organization (Benedication, by contrast, make sense because external intercession is the core root of &quot;miracles&quot; in Catholic theology, rather than personal enlightenment, and organizational membership can be the root of spiritual authority in Catholicism via the entire concept of the Church and ordination).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 01-06-2014, 06:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T04:15:53-08:00","id":41022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/32326-non-western-organizations?p=32742#post32742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not super comfortable taking the hypothetical Taoist Alchemist group and saying &quot;well we're really part of this Ancient Egyptian Cult&quot;. I think they work better having a completely separate organization and leadership, and have a long history of cultural exchange with the Ascending Ones.</div> </div> </div> </div>I concur. A separate group, a different philosophy. Even if the alchemy is the same, that's just down to there being a limited number of techniques that work (a detail that would fit into either philosophy).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}